6. THE TWO HYSTERESIS LAYERS

```
    ┌─────────────────────────────────────┐
    │  SQUARE FIGURE-8 TOROID             │  HYSTERESIS LAYER 1
    │                                     │  per-cell memory
    │    ┌─────────┐     ┌─────────┐      │  square B-H loop
    │    │  LOBE 1 │─────│  LOBE 2 │      │  flips at Hc
    │    └─────────┘  X  └─────────┘      │  reads the pairs
    │           │              │          │  does not drive them
