Bottom: lattice. Body memory. Permalloy hysteresis. Writes its own path through use.

Both write. Both remember. Both evolve through use.

Toroid = the cell's own history.
Lattice = the body's combined history.

One RC loop ties them. Top rotates. Bottom mirrors. One pair.

