7. MATERIALS

Hysteresis layer 1 — square figure-8 toroid:

· Primary: Molybdenum Permalloy (Mo-Permalloy). Squareness ratio (Br/Bs) ≈ 1.0. Square hysteresis loop.
· Alternative: Metglas (amorphous metal alloys). Squareness ≈ 1.0 after annealing.

Hysteresis layer 2 — lattice:

