10. THE THREE CURRENT TYPES

Every current type has a Field side and a Void side.

BC-DC

· Field up: drive out
· Void down: return to V_BUS
· Controls reinjection
· Signals up strain
· Confirms and denies

TC-AC

· Field up: lean positive
· Void down: lean negative
· The ternary choice

QC-RC

· Field up (views): BASELINE, DELTA, HEADING, RESULT
· Void down (actions): PULL, PUSH, FLIP, PASS
· Rotates the whole state
· Lattice bus is the mirror

DC and AC are phases of RC. One loop.

